# Cookbook: the Globals recipes (+finger, +where) and the dice roller.
# Scripts come from docs/mush-cookbook.md — see tests/cookbook.rs.

> create
> tester
> secretpass
> secretpass
expect: Account created

# --- +finger -------------------------------------------------------------
# fset must split key from value at the `=`. A greedy `%S+` for the key
# swallows the separator and yields a key of "themesong=Ride".
> fset themesong=Ride of the Valkyries
expect: Set
expect-not: Unknown field
> finger
expect: Theme Song
expect: Ride of the Valkyries
> fset themesong
expect: Cleared
> finger
expect-not: Ride of the Valkyries
> fset bogusfield=x
expect: Unknown field

# --- +where --------------------------------------------------------------
> where
expect: Who's Where
expect: tester
expect: 1 connected.

# --- dice roller ---------------------------------------------------------
> roll 3d6
expect: rolls 3d6
> roll 2d6+3
expect: rolls 2d6+3
> roll banana
expect: Usage
> roll 500d6
expect: not a die
